    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d275">

                <pb facs="0419" n="331" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg331"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/3147</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Chairman of the Commission of
                        Neutrals</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">White</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-05-22">May 22, 1933</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Bolivian Minister called and asked if the Neutral Commission was going to
                    have a meeting and call in the neighboring countries. I told him that we were
                    still waiting to hear from Argentina, Chile, and Brazil. The Minister was very
                    insistent that now was the time for us to have a meeting and I made it clear to
                    him that we are not in conflict with the League proposals and that I personally
                    hoped Bolivia would accept the latest League proposal.</p>
                <closer><signed>F[<hi rendition="#small-caps">rancis</hi>] W[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">hite</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
